  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阿本仔beh走ê前後"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大東亞戰爭ê尾溜hit兩、三冬，官廳禁止買賣黃金koh叫人bē-sái偷藏，ài總交交--出-來，政府kan-na出一張字紙hōo你做證明，意思是後過日本若戰贏ê時，ē連本帶利還--你，是講tsit塊空殼餅到tann iáu無人兌現--過，實在tsiânn hiau-hīng。M̄-nā án-ne，物資愈來愈ha̍t ê時tsūn，逐項mi̍h件tsiâu用配給--ê，有一本購買證ê簿仔，隨人紮tī身軀現買現寫，行tī街仔路，警察大人看著你kuānn tī手--裡ê米、肉、油、鹽、糖……即時叫你píng簿仔出來對，若有tîng-tânn iah是無ha̍h--ê，你就悽慘--ah，就知影hit-tsūn物資ê管制有偌嚴。講bóng講，tiānn-tiānn用ē著ê mi̍h件，mā是有人冒險leh做烏市ê生理，總--是有錢就買ē著。Khah鬧熱ê街市仔，kan-na ē-sái用火炭煮食，照配給pun hōo百姓來用，是因為hiânn柴kap塗炭有烏煙，ē hōo美國ê B-29認著所在ê緣故。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">山頂人作幾分田、ē-sái割偌濟粟，tio̍h去庄役場申告，扣掉厝內幾丁幾口ê食糧了後，照公定ê價siàu lóng總交hōo官廳，拄著歹年冬mā ē-sái減交--寡，有賰淡薄仔米，就緊té入去油罈，藏踮塗kat壁內底，一油罈囥兩斗，極ke四油罈八斗niâ。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tú-tsiah宣告無條件投降無偌久，tī基隆等船beh tńg--去ê阿本仔，頭起先有kā紮bē去ê布料、衫仔褲，排出來路邊huah俗價，m̄-koh tiānn-tiānn hōo台灣人kā搶ê緣故，無幾个敢公開排出來huah賣，姑不將就卸俗價賣hōo熟sāi人khah無代誌。無論查埔、查某所穿ê iu-khá-tah（ゆかた、浴衣），大軀koh闊，lóng用針tioh--ê，好拆koh緊摺，若用狹方（e̍h-hong）兩尺闊ê布幅來算，一領拄好一匹布，不止仔有路用。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上hàm--ê是規街仔路鬧熱滾滾，lóng leh賣íng過烏市買bē著ê管制品，濟kah ē驚--人。所有ê日本人mā即時變一个款樣，乖kah ná蝦仔--leh，親像iap尾仔狗án-ne，hōo台灣人kā凌治、蹧躂，看著實在tsiânn無siá-sì，拍kah phak tī塗跤爬--ê、行tī街仔路hông搶ê代誌，不時to lóng有，就準去拄--著，mā無人講按怎，真正是天地顛倒píng，iah若徛踮路邊kā日本人呸喙瀾、lé-khàng，iáu算是上古意ê齣頭，就知影冤仇tài有偌深，真正想bē-hiáu，人ê心肝khah ē變kah hiah-nī緊--leh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/ZWjdyV\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/ZWjdyV</a>）</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhaZ9vFUtwSBoUCTXbVa21rPXF6kN1R8T-IxRcuDCM4duCE0dZpGtKWoHQRfdihPOJOwXwPFlSDJX7f1nhAQXzFEUUMVhjjDQlCNTlNDNlUq4o5xa68YnEt5dg3BDZ2EAxFX3ascUx3r3DkMpTaXWWJMABMGMWNIY3QMhGjxGix9hJzA7OT5YmRb-wkW4wQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_7.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhaZ9vFUtwSBoUCTXbVa21rPXF6kN1R8T-IxRcuDCM4duCE0dZpGtKWoHQRfdihPOJOwXwPFlSDJX7f1nhAQXzFEUUMVhjjDQlCNTlNDNlUq4o5xa68YnEt5dg3BDZ2EAxFX3ascUx3r3DkMpTaXWWJMABMGMWNIY3QMhGjxGix9hJzA7OT5YmRb-wkW4wQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_7.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7ZNqEqfd3rAoaYReUCMn6rFdeH8_UpY4y6PqbTfC1likLf5IVSrGBYu9t7PSukqJ2taQL2_xZ1lqgLfAHkutfHuj5AbPuGepk4ZQsvu_84dN4c15/s1424/351%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" da